{"_doc":"Idioms of this series for this learning language (scripts/notes.py from scripts/idioms/<series>[_deck].txt). lem = lexicon keys (lowercase, space separated) matched in a row against gloss tokens; t = shown form; ko/en = short meaning; note_ko/note_en = optional one-line note; n = letters it appears in; first = [letter id, message index]. Patterns win over idioms, idioms over anchors.","lang":"ko","checked":false,"idioms":[{"lem":"마음 들다","t":"마음에 들","ko":"마음에 들다","en":"to like","note_ko":"‘마음에 들다’ 는 ‘좋아하다, 흡족하다’ 예요.","note_en":"마음에 들다 means “to be to one's liking”.","n":5,"first":["c1-l2",1]},{"lem":"잘 지내다","t":"잘 지내","ko":"잘 지내다","en":"to be well","n":2,"first":["c1-l4",4]},{"lem":"마음 놓다","t":"마음을 놓은","ko":"마음을 놓다","en":"to be relieved","n":1,"first":["c6-l6",0]},{"lem":"상관 없다","t":"상관 없어요","ko":"상관없다","en":"it doesn't matter","n":1,"first":["c2-l2",4]},{"lem":"그 뒤","t":"그 뒤에도","ko":"그 뒤","en":"after that","n":1,"first":["c4-l5",2]},{"lem":"한 번","t":"한 번도","ko":"한 번","en":"once","n":1,"first":["c6-l7",1]},{"lem":"더 이상","t":"더 이상","ko":"더 이상","en":"any more","n":1,"first":["c4-l2",2]},{"lem":"하루 종일","t":"하루 종일","ko":"하루 종일","en":"all day","n":1,"first":["c2-l4",0]},{"lem":"얼마 전","t":"얼마 전에","ko":"얼마 전","en":"a while ago","n":1,"first":["c2-l7",1]},{"lem":"비하다 데","t":"비할 데","ko":"비할 데 (없다)","en":"beyond compare","n":3,"first":["c1-l3",0]},{"lem":"잘 있다","t":"잘 있어요","ko":"잘 있다","en":"to be well","n":3,"first":["c1-l2",0]},{"lem":"안 되다","t":"안 되고","ko":"안 되다","en":"no good, must not","n":3,"first":["c5-l5",2]},{"lem":"눈물 나다","t":"눈물이 났어요","ko":"눈물이 나다","en":"tears come","n":1,"first":["c2-l7",2]},{"lem":"화 나다","t":"화가 나서","ko":"화가 나다","en":"to get angry","n":1,"first":["c6-l4",2]},{"lem":"기분 좋다","t":"기분 좋게","ko":"기분이 좋다","en":"to feel good","n":2,"first":["c5-l7",4]},{"lem":"배 고프다","t":"배가 고파요","ko":"배가 고프다","en":"to be hungry","n":1,"first":["c5-l4",4]},{"lem":"자리 잡다","t":"자리를 잡고","ko":"자리를 잡다","en":"to settle","n":1,"first":["c5-l7",4]},{"lem":"숨 막히다","t":"숨 막